  <entity00164742:DescriptionOfTheMaturityAnalysisAmountOfFinancialLiabilitiesOfDisclosureOfMaturityAnalysisForNonDerivativeFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfMaturityAnalysisForNonDerivativeFinancialLiabilitiesTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">상기 만기분석은 금융부채의 할인하지 않은 현금흐름을 기초로 연결실체가 지급하여야 하는 가장 빠른 만기일에 근거하여 작성되었으며, 원금 및 이자의 현금흐름을 포함하고 있습니다.</entity00164742:DescriptionOfTheMaturityAnalysisAmountOfFinancialLiabilitiesOfDisclosureOfMaturityAnalysisForNonDerivativeFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfMaturityAnalysisForNonDerivativeFinancialLiabilitiesTableOfItems>
